{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）早上10時10分，警方接報指，葵涌興寧路12號近新都會廣場對開，有一輛垃圾車撞倒一名女途人，事主陷入昏迷，救援人員趕抵救援，經檢驗後於現場證實不治。意外原因仍有待調查。據知，事主年約80多歲。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事垃圾車。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169960124987609088302849.jpeg/mGQtSpL8xP04LcevPnnQJBc0r2WLv3qRy8mMGO7JjBg\"/><figcaption>涉事垃圾車。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員以白布遮蓋遺體。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169960120579264512415823.jpeg/S9mVxu4vty2YhOJh4JF-Esrs19rJlS7NmzHak74x2pM\"/><figcaption>人員以白布遮蓋遺體。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一隻相信是屬於事主的鞋。（朱子熙攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169960493771657216264507.jpeg/tuS3MDyO8XRuPvWgSu6HEjf5JTNcBE_08AH1_dUB9f0\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一隻相信是屬於事主的鞋。（朱子熙攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T02:59:48.830299+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}